    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1. 伴随矩阵的概念与公式",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            341,
            141,
            576,
            159
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "伴随矩阵：由矩阵A的行列式|A所有的代数余子式所构成的形如",
        "bbox": [
            302,
            177,
            870,
            217
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "img_path": "images/abbde845eab8f086fb007da8fa947cb7a6bab9b99329fc012110e913bac98a27.jpg",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{bmatrix} A_{11} & A_{21} & \\cdots & A_{n1} \\\\ A_{12} & A_{22} & \\cdots & A_{n2} \\\\ \\vdots & \\vdots & & \\vdots \\\\ A_{1n} & A_{2n} & \\cdots & A_{nn} \\end{bmatrix}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            497,
            222,
            677,
            315
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "的矩阵称为矩阵A的伴随矩阵，记为 $A^{*}$",
        "bbox": [
            304,
            321,
            647,
            337
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例如 $\\mathbf{0}\\boldsymbol{A} = \\begin{bmatrix} 2 & 1 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 1 & -2 & 1 \\end{bmatrix}$ ,计算代数余子式，得",
        "bbox": [
            341,
            344,
            739,
            409
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "img_path": "images/c37bc5146497b2f0219771b3fe4923a34141b6751bbe584889b1a95b826142cc.jpg",
        "text": "$$\nA_{11} = \\begin{vmatrix} 0 & 3 \\\\ -2 & 1 \\end{vmatrix} = 6, A_{12} = - \\begin{vmatrix} -1 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 1 \\end{vmatrix} = 4,\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            339,
            413,
            721,
            456
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "img_path": "images/0514e7ea05764c00a8c46d737696c6718e63b21dbb9943e17f8f1b9dd9c51d70.jpg",
        "text": "$$\nA_{13} = \\begin{vmatrix} -1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -2 \\end{vmatrix} = 2  ,\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            339,
            461,
            546,
            502
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "img_path": "images/0ebb63b2a09b94655e55213f59842af0f9a369d26a7c7b5c0160571cabfac80e.jpg",
        "text": "$$\nA_{21} = - \\begin{vmatrix} 1 & 2 \\\\ - 2 & 1 \\end{vmatrix} = - 5, A_{22} = \\begin{vmatrix} 2 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 1 \\end{vmatrix} = 0,\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            339,
            506,
            715,
            550
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "img_path": "images/0d9cfeff2e45936ecc641db9dce7793cc8eaf35f7f5fc8f3fafd73f3e3b9bc28.jpg",
        "text": "$$\nA_{^{23}} = - \\begin{vmatrix} 2 & 1 \\\\ 1 & - 2 \\end{vmatrix} = 5 ,\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            339,
            555,
            539,
            596
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "img_path": "images/80d4db137ad6a2176820398b8598015d1069cc478bc1af62dbd5ced79e4a4a47.jpg",
        "text": "$$\nA_{31} = \\begin{vmatrix} 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 3 \\end{vmatrix} = 3, A_{32} = - \\begin{vmatrix} 2 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 3 \\end{vmatrix} = - 8,\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            339,
            600,
            715,
            643
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "img_path": "images/ea5fdbadb924e5fedfe90319b579c12fe47ed7dc4fd8f8487070c6ce3e5e7e0f.jpg",
        "text": "$$\nA_{33} = \\begin{vmatrix} 2 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0 \\end{vmatrix} = 1  ,\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            339,
            648,
            526,
            690
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "按定义 $\\boldsymbol{A}^{*} = \\begin{bmatrix} 6 & -5 & 3 \\\\ 4 & 0 & -8 \\\\ 2 & 5 & 1 \\end{bmatrix}$",
        "bbox": [
            339,
            696,
            594,
            760
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "伴随矩阵的公式：",
        "bbox": [
            339,
            766,
            489,
            783
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "img_path": "images/a28c680553e4b2a5c68c9eead40dff2708af4c245fc2e24ac19d1aa93099e4a2.jpg",
        "text": "$$\n\\boldsymbol{A}\\boldsymbol{A}^{*} = \\boldsymbol{A}^{*} \\boldsymbol{A} = \\left| \\boldsymbol{A} \\right| \\boldsymbol{E}.\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            416,
            790,
            620,
            808
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "img_path": "images/ae2eb6634739531d18e0a537c83e049c0e0eff8ce12d24e794c8022e7570b744.jpg",
        "text": "$$\n\\left( \\boldsymbol{A}^{*} \\right)^{-1} = \\left( \\boldsymbol{A}^{-1} \\right)^{*} = \\frac{1}{\\left| \\boldsymbol{A} \\right|} \\boldsymbol{A} \\quad \\left( \\left| \\boldsymbol{A} \\right| \\neq 0 \\right).\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            416,
            815,
            779,
            847
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "img_path": "images/393cf9d3fc68de29c743664abe89581cf53836c844cec3bd11544692bab9ea4d.jpg",
        "text": "$$\n(k\\boldsymbol{A})^{*} = k^{n - 1}\\boldsymbol{A}^{*}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            418,
            853,
            569,
            871
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "img_path": "images/fffa4d5f463c6c6bec57f294df5d6fe939a2fbf85e338e55c5207cfe8702bc47.jpg",
        "text": "$$\n\\left( \\boldsymbol{A}^{*} \\right)^{\\mathrm{T}} = \\left( \\boldsymbol{A}^{\\mathrm{T}} \\right)^{*}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            418,
            876,
            569,
            895
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "img_path": "images/e6a9b79bf4c036f353f05deb4771b85dc9c85d0b9d5652db5b8b8655e9729cfa.jpg",
        "text": "$$\n\\left| \\boldsymbol{A}^{*} \\right| = \\left| \\boldsymbol{A} \\right|^{n - 1}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            418,
            900,
            568,
            919
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
